[{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"僕が、ATMから戻って、洋服店に戻ると、こいしがある列の洋服を真剣そうな表情で眺めていた。「どうしたんですか？」\n東方Project二次創作作品","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_001_操夢.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"4E6F62D4-DFC5-4610-96A4-FBE1E10108BB","duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"第1スライド","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.001.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.70498866213152,"seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"「ねぇ、これどっちがいいと思う？」\n作成者：zuyasi","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_002_古明地こいし.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"004153A8-3256-4FC4-9BC9-BFB47A3F33C6","duration":3.5,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"第2スライド","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.002.jpeg","voiceDuration":2.6143537414965987,"seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"「えっと…」僕は、いきなりそう言われ、戸惑ってしまう。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"「えっと…」僕は、いきなりそう言われ、戸惑ってしまう。","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"紅夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"audioTrack":"track_voice_char_5156","id":"569AB9B8-E16E-4BCE-B025-C81D1C0AB748","duration":3,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"中扉","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.003.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 4","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"だが、あることを思い出し、彼女の質問に答えを出す。\n「長く使えて、飽きない服を選ぶといいですよ。」\n制作ソフト及び協力\nGemini\nTohoStuido","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_操夢.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"E230659C-0F76-484C-95E1-E9671D1B1C20","duration":4.800000000000001,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"第4スライド","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.004.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.016938775510204,"seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 5","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"「そう…」私は、期待していた返答が得られずにため息が出る。\nそれから、私は一人で、買う服を決めるのだった。","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_古明地こいし.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceCharacter":"古明地こいし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"古明地こいし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%93%E3%81%84%E3%81%97","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"A4D1B498-2AE1-4132-9583-EC86470F303C","duration":5.2,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","slideTitle":"第5スライド","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.005.jpeg","voiceDuration":10.223469387755102,"seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"東方Project二次創作作品　Powerd By zuyasi","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"元女子校の日常","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundName":"単色背景","characterName":"","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"8EB6D0B2-AAA1-4B23-A0B4-06F26D565225","duration":2,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"タイトル","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.006.jpeg","seVolume":1},{"seStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 7","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","telop":"それから僕たちは、こいしが歩くのに少し疲れていたので、休憩スペースで休みをとっていた。すると、アリスがやってくる。","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_操夢.wav","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","characterName":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"9B211DD6-369E-403D-8464-D32E120F9666","duration":5.7,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","slideTitle":"第7スライド","transitionName":"なし","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.007.jpeg","voiceDuration":8.140861678004535,"seVolume":1},{"seVolume":1,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.65,"duration":4.7,"audioTrack