0,"slideTitle":"第12スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.012.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","duration":5.6000000000000005,"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_操夢.wav","transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし"},{"telop":"私は、彼が出した旅行券をよく見る。行き先は琉球郡沖縄本島とあり、そこで出発日が明日であることに気がつく。","title":"シーン 13","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.663356009070295,"id":"12A89E2C-8D79-4A6B-9F10-180E5F959C2F","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第13スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.013.jpeg","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","duration":5.2,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし"},{"telop":"「まさか、今日中に準備して、明日の朝イチに空港集合なんて、言いませんよね…、今日は、出発日前日ですけど…。」","title":"シーン 14","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.644807256235827,"id":"340605D7-1E71-46C7-BA2A-099959B232EE","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第14スライド","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/