":"「確か、あの班の班長は、パチュリーが使っている研究室で学んでいる大学院生だったよな…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"id":"D3D23BEC-1BF2-4F5D-85FE-98FE270D592D","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":6.416666666666667,"title":"シーン 41","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.041.jpeg","seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲"},{"slideTitle":"第42スライド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_美鈴.wav","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","animationName":"なし","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","duration":3.5,"characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「ええ、班長の名前はアリス・マーガトロイドですが…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"id":"1C8DB53D-568B-466E-B1C4-E4531F6FB0A7","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":2.137573696145125,"title":"シーン 42","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.042.jpeg","seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲"},{"slideTitle":"第43スライド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_隠岐奈.wav","voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","animationName":"なし","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","duration":5.9,"characterName":"隠岐奈","telop":"「なら、パチュリーに言いつけて、確認させて、あなたがその内容を聞いて、私に報告しなさい、期限は今日の午後3時までだ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"id":"FE8EA44C-5923-42AA-8F04-022A9DF2ED34","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":8.742290249433106,"title":"シーン 43","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.043.jpeg","seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲"},{"slideTitle":"第44スライド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_美鈴.wav","voiceCharacter":"美鈴","animationName":"なし","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","duration":3.5,"characterName":"美鈴","telop":"「承知しました…聞き出してきます。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E7%BE%8E%E9%88%B4","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"id":"ED34AD90-37E6-4023-A89E-DF3D3455EC0F","bgmVolume":0.65,"transitionName":"なし","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":1.5932199546485262,"title":"シーン 44","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.044.jpeg","seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲"},{"title":"シーン 45","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%9A%A0%E5%B2%90%E5%A5%88","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"隠岐奈","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"5F53EAFA-0958-413B-8FB8-C8EE692A24AC","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"隠岐奈","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_隠岐奈.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第45スライド","voiceDuration":9.177687074829931,"telop":"私は、彼女が去ると、手元の机からある書類を取り出す。それには、例の彼が遠足後に受ける、試験の詳細が記されていた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.045.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 46","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"duration":2,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"57741AD5-FCAA-43C2-B5AE-985B1593212F","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"ナレーション","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第46スライド","telop":"それから、彼らは…","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.046.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 47","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.6000000000000005,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"6C88A56B-A655-49EC-B3D7-A859E5A10E76","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第47スライド","voiceDuration":9.162607709750567,"telop":"それから、僕たちは、ホテルに着くと、予約した四人部屋に入る。そして、入浴の順番を決めて、アリスが先に浴室に入る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.047.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 48","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"7F83A5A4-C7F4-4DFF-AFE8-7CFBDCDC2C91","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"さ&り","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_古明地さとり.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第48スライド","voiceDuration":3.088979591836735,"telop":"「あの…女子3人と一緒の部屋で寝泊まりで…いいんですか？」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.048.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 49","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"C996B862-4F35-427F-AA56-75003020E5B1","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_操夢.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第49スライド","voiceDuration":3.666938775510204,"telop":"「ええ、条件に見合った部屋が、ここしかなかったので…。」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.049.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 50","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"5069C593-5298-462B-8A48-35680688FBBD","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"さ&り","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_古明地さとり.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第50スライド","voiceDuration":2.068185941043084,"telop":"「そうですか…。それならいいんですけど…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.050.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 51","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.7,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"719D6473-C077-4E84-B0C3-2A7A595BD3CD","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_操夢.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第51スライド","voiceDuration":7.460430839002267,"telop":"「それより、アリスさんの入力が終わったら、こいしさんを目覚めさせてください…」僕は、そう言いながら、こいしを見る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.051.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 52","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.800000000000001,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"3C2CAA9E-7835-4B9D-85E0-0120B62BE260","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_操夢.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第52スライド","voiceDuration":8.457165532879818,"telop":"そこには、寝落ち寸前のような表情で、こくこくと頭が動いているこいしの姿があった。「今寝ちゃうと、夜眠れませんから…」","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.052.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 53","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.9,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"03F60EEE-3118-40A2-BB96-6DF53564A8AF","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"さ&り","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_古明地さとり.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第53スライド","voiceDuration":6.592585034013606,"telop":"「分かりました…」私と彼がそう話していると、浴室の扉が開く。そして、妹を起こし、入浴に向かわせた。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.053.jpeg"},{"title":"シーン 54","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.2,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"5C9DD9D4-A34E-43DD-B107-0CF9460838F5","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideTitle":"第54スライド","voiceDuration":6.35297052154195,"telop":"私は、入浴が終わると、ポケベルに着信があったことに気がつく。そして、さとりと彼の了承を得ると電話に出る。","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.054.jpeg"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.055.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AA%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BB%E3%83%9E%E3%83%BC%E3%82%AC%E3%83%88%E3%83%AD%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89","duration":3.5,"animationName":"なし","title":"シーン 55","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 少女綺想曲","telop":"「もしもし、どうしたんですか？」","id":"B421783E-EF55-42B3-9E46-60D3156FE3E7","slideTitle":"第55スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceCharacter":"アリス・マーガトロイド","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_アリス・マーガトロイド.wav","voiceDuration":1.5932653061224489,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95\/元女子校の日常　第18話_5125d7fb95.056.jpeg","seStartTimeOffset":0,